  m_text: 'Congratulations!


    You managed to escape from the space prison and
    destroy all enemies.

    However, your gravity rudder is damaged, you as a pilot
    can control your ship, but do not count on 100% controllability. Be careful,
    try not to lose control near meteorites.



    Tip 1: You can turn the ship
    with a two-finger rotation gesture.



    Tip 2: You can turn the ship by catching
    on a meteorite.



    Bad news - Your gun is jammed - it shoots constantly.
    Good news - the gun is powered by a nuclear reactor, the shells do not run out!'
